# hypernix.download

Hub snapshot downloads with short-name resolution, gated repo support, and offline cache.

## Documentation pages

- [Download](../../#/docs/Download) · [MDXL source](pages/Download.mdxl)
- [HuggingFace Models](../../#/docs/HuggingFace-Models) · [MDXL source](pages/HuggingFace-Models.mdxl)
- [ModelIndex](../../#/docs/ModelIndex) · [MDXL source](pages/ModelIndex.mdxl)

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `ModelInfo()`

Metadata for a known model on the HuggingFace Hub.

### `resolve_repo_id(name_or_repo_id) -> str`

Resolve a short name (``\"nano-mini\"``) to a full ``org/repo`` id.

### `resolve_model_info(name_or_repo_id) -> ModelInfo | None`

Return the :class:`ModelInfo` for a known short-or-full name, else None.

### `verify_snapshot(model_dir) -> list[str]`

Verify a downloaded snapshot contains everything `convert` needs.

### `download_model(repo_id='ray0rf1re/hyper-nix.1', revision=None, cache_dir=None, local_dir=None, model_dir_name=None, token=None, quiet=False, verify=True) -> Path`

Download a full HuggingFace model snapshot and return its directory.

